Power Connections

Battery (+) --------> Arduino VIN (or DC Jack)
Battery (-) --------> Arduino GND

Red LED:
Arduino D6 → 220Ω Resistor → LED (+)
LED (−) → GND

Green LED:
Arduino D7 → 220Ω Resistor → LED (+)
LED (−) → GND